		(r33.1657 - and a level above that peak crosses nothing, so its)
		(start fell back to the floor scan and landed 0.2509 clear of)
		(the pre-finish contour, one whole pre-finish allowance out,)
		(while every neighbour started ON it.)
		(greatEndian: the parallel ramp has to be in the same line as)
