	(0.4 mm PAST the reference and the old test - only "never in front)
	(of it" - let that through, so the tool still arrived at the cutting)
	(diameter inside the stock. When this window begins at or in front)
	(of Begin Z it is the FIRST interval, and the pass starts exactly)
