			o<s_rch> endif
			(A CROSSING BEYOND THE REACH IS CLAMPED, NOT REJECTED. Rejecting it)
			(stops the level on the floor allowance, and over a chamfer that)
			(leaves a 0.447 mm stub where the feature is 1 mm long. greatEndian)
			(chose to let the pass run past the floor stop and cut nearer the)
			(contour than fin_off + prefin_off allows, so the reach becomes the)
			(LENGTH of the extension rather than a test on it. Levels whose)
			(crossing already lies inside the reach - every one on both test)
			(projects, 0.90 to 1.0034 mm - are untouched.)
